# ── דן שערים חשמליים (Dan Electric Gates) environment template ──────────────
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill real values. Never commit `.env.local`.

# Web3Forms access key the lead form (components/forms/LeadForm.tsx) posts with. It is a
# public-by-design key, not a secret — the form runs entirely client-side and the key
# identifies the destination inbox to Web3Forms, nothing more. The manifest
# (Israeli services sites/roster/sites/dangates.json) carries the real value as
# siteConfig.formAccessKey; this variable is only an optional local override.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=""
